// Ember Clans defences and shrine buildings (batch 2: Ancestor Shrine, Forge, Watchtower, Palisade, Gate),
// baked into assets/buildings/ember-defences.pak by tools/gc_artbake
// (`cargo run -p gc_artbake --release -- --config assets-src/buildings/ember-defences.ron --out assets/buildings/ember-defences.pak`).
// Each building has four models: its construction stages `#1` (foundation), `#2` (frame) and `#3`
// (nearly done), then the finished building under its own name, exactly as in data/rosters.
// All four share one texture set (one material) and keep their authored positions in tiles
// (`keep_origin`), with the origin at the middle of the footprint on the ground and the door
// facing +z. Sources and scripts: the project's design/buildings/ folder (docs/21-buildings.md).
(
    models: [
        (
            name: "Palisade #1",
            source: "shared:grubcraft/buildings/ember/palisade/stage1.glb",
            height: 2.4,
            keep_origin: true,
            clips: {},
            lod_triangles: (2500, 900, 300, 120),
            textures: Some((
                albedo: "shared:grubcraft/buildings/ember/palisade/albedo.png",
